<h2>1. Who is responsible for your data?</h2>
<p>
    The controller of your personal data is <strong>Rouss Consulting SRL</strong>, a private
    limited company incorporated under Belgian law, which publishes the <strong>HouseFlow</strong>
    service, registered with the Belgian Crossroads Bank for Enterprises under number
    <strong>0805.984.579</strong> (VAT <strong>BE 0805 984 579</strong>).
</p>
<p>
    For any question about your personal data, or to exercise your rights, write to
    <a href="mailto:@LegalConstants.PrivacyContactEmail">@LegalConstants.PrivacyContactEmail</a>.
</p>

<h2>2. Do we have a Data Protection Officer (DPO)?</h2>
<p>
    No. Appointing a DPO is not mandatory for HouseFlow: we are not a public body, our core
    activity does not consist of large-scale systematic monitoring of individuals, and we do not
    process special categories of data on a large scale (Article 37 GDPR).
</p>
<p>
    We have nevertheless appointed a <strong>privacy contact</strong>, reachable at
    <a href="mailto:@LegalConstants.PrivacyContactEmail">@LegalConstants.PrivacyContactEmail</a>.
</p>

