</ul>
<p>You may also seek a judicial remedy.</p>

<h2>10. Automated decision-making and profiling</h2>
<p>
    <strong>We take no automated decision producing legal effects concerning you, and we carry out
    no profiling.</strong> The maintenance scores shown in the app are a plain calculation of due
    dates from the data you enter; they have no consequence beyond what is displayed.
</p>

<h2>11. Cookies and trackers</h2>
<p>
    HouseFlow uses <strong>strictly necessary trackers only</strong>, required to deliver the
    service you requested. As such they are exempt from consent (Article 82 of the French Data
    Protection Act): <strong>no cookie banner is forced upon you</strong>, since there would be no
    real choice to offer. We inform you of them here.
</p>

